    solution but excluded from the solution build configuration. Build it with:
      "C:\Program Files\Microsoft Visual Studio\18\Community\MSBuild\Current\Bin\MSBuild.exe"
        src\csharp\OrikaGo.LanguageService\OrikaGo.LanguageService.csproj /restore /p:Configuration=Release
  -->
